        "x": 0.22433497595891158,
        "y": 0.2004448619914807
      },
      "level": 0.20789290939100158
    },
    {
      "text": "For Senior High School, the following policies apply.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.017623545601963997,
        "width": 0.31589146455128986,
        "x": 0.2577519443993273,
        "y": 0.2265625003076941
      },
      "level": 0.2265625003076941
    },
    {
      "text": "For Grade 11, he/she may be a candidate for honors if the general",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.017578125,
        "width": 0.43604648113250727,
        "x": 0.2558139632854907,
        "y": 0.2456054686787622
      },
      "level": 0.2456054686787622
    },
    {
      "text": "weighted average is 90% and above for two semesters. There is no final grade",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.019099745899438858,
        "width": 0.4689922332763672,
        "x": 0.22480621363313422,
        "y": 0.25726744202661067
      },
      "level": 0.25726744202661067
    },
    {
      "text": "of below 85% in any subject of the current year. The average GWA will be taken",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01744185946881771,
        "width": 0.4689922332763672,
        "x": 0.2248062148056147,
        "y": 0.2703488377437888
      },
      "level": 0.2703488377437888
    },
    {
      "text": "from 1st and 2nd semesters, 50% for each.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.019609104841947556,
        "width": 0.262411375840505,
        "x": 0.22431833648439406,
        "y": 0.2799855057253392
      },
      "level": 0.28598223450694993
    },
    {
      "text": "For Grade 12, he/she may be a candidate for honors during recognition or",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01611328125,
        "width": 0.4379844665527343,
        "x": 0.25581396097427905,
        "y": 0.3037109370363401
      },
      "level": 0.3037109370363401
    },
    {
      "text": "graduation if he/she obtained 90% and above during the final semester and",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01761218998581171,
        "width": 0.4689922332763673,
        "x": 0.2248062032746072,
        "y": 0.31686046583245164
      },
      "level": 0.31686046583245164
    },
    {
      "text": "three consecutive semesters (Grade 11 second semester, Grade 12 first",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.015988372266292572,
